AltoRewardsOracle::getPrice()
├── given oracle is not initiated
│   └── when lastPriceUpdateTimestamp is zero
│       └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleNotInitiated
└── given oracle is initiated
    └── when lastPriceUpdateTimestamp is greater than zero
        ├── it should return the cached price
        └── it should not modify any state
